    "title": "Pair of Oklahoma edge commits set to play in the 2026 Under Armour All-America Game - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Collin Kennedy ,\n11 hours ago The 2026 edition of the Under Armour All-American Game is on its way. Two edge commits for the Oklahoma Sooners will participate in the storied high school showcase. The game will be played on Saturday, Jan. 3 at Spec Martin Stadium in DeLand, Florida. More than 100 recruits across the 2026 and 2027 cycles have been invited and will be split between two squads: Team Pearls and Team Roses. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 3",
